==Latin==

===Etymology===
{{root|la|ine-pro|*h₂erh₃-}}
From {{inh|la|itc-pro|*araō}}, from {{inh|la|ine-pro|*h₂éryeti|t=to plough}}, from the root {{m|ine-pro|*h₂erh₃-}}. The root-final laryngeal was lost in the Proto-Indo-European verb, but was restored in Proto-Italic.

Cognates include {{cog|grc|ἀρόω}}, {{cog|cu|орати}}, {{cog|lt|arti}}, and {{cog|ang|erian}} (archaic {{cog|en|ear#Etymology_3}}).

